  "decision": "V95 is a promising quality candidate: photo/known-camera means and tested weak-detail response improve. Keep V43 as working reference while addressing saturated high-noise color tails and unresolved unseen-camera uncertainty. No automatic promotion, full-frame or speed trial.",
